{
    "id":  2941,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "40W LED Downlight Round - Philips CertaDrive - CCT - UGR17- CRI+90  - IP54",
    "reference":  "DW40WPHL-CCT-90644",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eCOLOUR SELECTABLE: Our Philips Certa Drive 40W recessed circular LED downlight has a colour temperature selector, cool white, neutral white and warm white. UGR17. 120º angle. The front of the luminaire is IP54. Colour rendering index - CRI +90. Start saving on your electricity bill now!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Downlight 40W - Philips Certa Drive- CCT - UGR17 - IP54 - Circular\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur Philips CertaDrive downlight with 40W output is characterised by its easy handling, providing precise and customised lighting in any interior space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition, with its high UGR you will not have problems with glare, as it has a low glare index UGR17.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSELECTABLE COLOUR: Our downlight has a colour temperature selector, allowing you to choose between cool white -6000K-, neutral white -4000K- and warm white -3000K-.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to its colour selection system, you can adapt it to the needs of your business or your home, choosing the desired colour for each room or hall.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe high-efficiency light source with SMD2835 technology delivers high luminosity and will perfectly replace traditional bulbs, providing savings of more than 80%.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its functional design, it is quick and easy to install.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts high colour rendering index +92 guarantees natural colour rendering.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIts aluminium body is specifically designed so that the temperature of the LED is optimal and to achieve the best performance and durability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe front of the luminaire is IP54 so it can also be used in wet areas such as bathrooms and in outdoor areas under cover.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts reflector, made of technical polycarbonate, creates a high quality, uniform and spotless light.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses: LED Downlight 40W - Philips Certa Drive- CCT - UGR17 - IP54 - Circular\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShops\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRestaurants\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMuseums\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShopping arcades\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShopping centres\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBaths\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffices\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCorridors\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShop windows\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/Ambientadas/Placa-LED-Circular-Acero%20Inox.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
